# Frontend setup and run instructions

This workspace uses the `employee-management-system` React + Vite frontend.

## Frontend location
- `employee-management-system/`

## Startup commands
1. Open a terminal in the repo root:
   ```bash
   cd "c:\Users\Rishi Garg\OneDrive\Desktop\I soft\ri\employee-management-system"
   ```
2. Install frontend dependencies (if needed):
   ```bash
   npm install
   ```
3. Start the frontend dev server:
   ```bash
   npm run dev
   ```

## Local URL
- The Vite app usually runs on `http://localhost:5173`
- If that port is busy, Vite will pick the next available port automatically.

## Notes
- The frontend is configured to proxy `/api` requests to the backend on `http://localhost:4000`.
- Main app entry files:
  - `employee-management-system/src/main.jsx`
  - `employee-management-system/src/App.jsx`
  - `employee-management-system/vite.config.js`
